{"product":{"id":7957300510798,"title":"YSL Y Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis set has three standout creations from YSL’s Y collection — a deep woody signature, an intense aromatic fresh scent, and a crisp citrus cologne. Three miniatures that showcase the modern masculine character of Y before going full bottle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eY Le Parfum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is apple, grapefruit, ginger, and aldehydes over sage, lavender, and geranium, settling into tonka bean, cedarwood, olibanum, and patchouli — rich, smooth, and confidently masculine.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eY Eau de Parfum Intense\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is bergamot, ginger, and juniper berries over lavender, geranium, and sage, settling into vetiver, patchouli, and cedarwood — fresh, powerful, and sophisticated.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eY L'Elixir \/ Y Iced Cologne\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is bergamot, lemon, and ginger over lavender and geranium, settling into cedarwood, ambergris, and patchouli — crisp, refreshing, and effortlessly versatile.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree Y signatures, one refined set — the perfect way to discover your ideal Y fragrance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-07-01T10:14:34+05:30","handle":"bundle-name-sku-in-stock-status-actions-ysl-y-sample-set-y-le-p